{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/extras/1a6b49ec1684e1519999ec67ca2dabb7.avif?t=1757984794\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cold is Just the Beginning.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scientific expedition to the desolate Zhokhov Island is completely disrupted while abnormal magnetic anomalies occur. Among the team is Anna, a young geophysicist with a clouded past and a sharp mind. When disaster strikes and the crew becomes trapped in a long-forgotten Soviet military base beneath the permafrost, Anna must fight to survive and uncover the truth hidden beneath the ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But something else is buried here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she searches for a way out, Anna is haunted by surreal visions, grotesque figures, and distorted echoes of a twisted past. The deeper she goes, the more she feels drawn to this place, as if it strangely welcomes her back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/extras/71574a3513d80df67902f5d6f457fecf.poster.avif?t=1757984794\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/extras/71574a3513d80df67902f5d6f457fecf.webm?t=1757984794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/extras/71574a3513d80df67902f5d6f457fecf.mp4?t=1757984794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The cold may be deadly, but what lies beneath is far more chilling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/extras/ae5e8eb60b7f8a7cc90fe17546f7eaad.avif?t=1757984794\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival Horror, Reimagined</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kriophobia </i>is a return to the roots of third-person psychological horror, where story, survival, and atmosphere are core. Inspired by genre classics like Silent Hill, Resident Evil, Rule of Rose and Haunting Ground, this is a slow-burning, symbol-rich experience where every shadow matters and every step forward reveals more than it should.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade or confront, your choice. Combat is tense, creatures are unforgiving, and often best avoided entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the elements. Resources are limited, the cold is lethal, and every decision counts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/extras/c49a9716b77a977b9d326704a146ce56.poster.avif?t=1757984794\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/extras/c49a9716b77a977b9d326704a146ce56.webm?t=1757984794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/extras/c49a9716b77a977b9d326704a146ce56.mp4?t=1757984794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a broken legacy. Navigate the ruins of Cold War obsession and personal trauma through exploration, puzzles, and atmospheric storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience striking visuals. A unique art style blending comic book ink with painterly textures, brought to life through hand-crafted static camera angles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear the haunting echoes. An eerie Slavic-inspired soundtrack immerses you in dread and loneliness as Anna's fractured history unfolds.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/extras/8676d54bf9ebe1bfed5eddc86a6be32f.poster.avif?t=1757984794\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/extras/8676d54bf9ebe1bfed5eddc86a6be32f.webm?t=1757984794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/extras/8676d54bf9ebe1bfed5eddc86a6be32f.mp4?t=1757984794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some places should stay buried. Some memories should not.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1604630?t=1757984794","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/dd6966b9732764b9832c4ccf23d9ecdb5bfdf4cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757984794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/940b4f441a414a5df4e85c621b98fe5a5d893d4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757984794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604630/940b4f441a414a5df4e85c621b98fe5a5d893d4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757984794","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"